    "detailed_description": "This game merges stars produced from a black hole,<br />\r\nThe game is a puzzle game to grow stars by merging stars produced from a black hole.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo give you the full experience of the collision of the 15 types of stars (satellites, quasi-planets, and planets) in our solar system,<br />\r\nThe game is a 3D game with added physics, depth and rotation controls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay can be controlled with the left hand only,<br />\r\nEnjoy the game while enjoying a snack with your right hand while listening to the soothing music.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will be baptized with a lot of physics before the sun is formed,<br />\r\nWe hope you enjoy the chaos of the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Attention\u3011<br />\r\nI am using my favorite music by scottbuckley for this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs long as his music is credited with his name,<br />\r\nYou can use his music for free in any project (including commercial ones) as long as his name is credited.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThat's why his credit is always displayed in the lower left corner of the game screen,<br />\r\nEven if he distributes his music on Youtube, there is no particular problem,<br />\r\nHowever, in case you are worried about a copyright infringement claim,<br />\r\nSet the volume to 0 for background music only in the in-game settings screen, or<br />\r\nWe recommend that you display the following credit in the summary field.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll Music by Scott Buckley - released under CC-BY 4.0.",
    "about_the_game": "This game merges stars produced from a black hole,<br />\r\nThe game is a puzzle game to grow stars by merging stars produced from a black hole.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTo give you the full experience of the collision of the 15 types of stars (satellites, quasi-planets, and planets) in our solar system,<br />\r\nThe game is a 3D game with added physics, depth and rotation controls.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay can be controlled with the left hand only,<br />\r\nEnjoy the game while enjoying a snack with your right hand while listening to the soothing music.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou will be baptized with a lot of physics before the sun is formed,<br />\r\nWe hope you enjoy the chaos of the game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u3010Attention\u3011<br />\r\nI am using my favorite music by scottbuckley for this game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs long as his music is credited with his name,<br />\r\nYou can use his music for free in any project (including commercial ones) as long as his name is credited.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThat's why his credit is always displayed in the lower left corner of the game screen,<br />\r\nEven if he distributes his music on Youtube, there is no particular problem,<br />\r\nHowever, in case you are worried about a copyright infringement claim,<br />\r\nSet the volume to 0 for background music only in the in-game settings screen, or<br />\r\nWe recommend that you display the following credit in the summary field.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAll Music by Scott Buckley - released under CC-BY 4.0.",
